      "title": "New handlers have no covering tests",
      "description": "The change adds Search, Count and Upstream, but the repository contains no test files. Nothing exercises the new error paths. Bugs like the stuck lock and the nil body panic reached review without any test catching them. Add httptest-based tests for each new handler, including the missing key and failed upstream paths.",
